Approval by the Board of Education, upon recommendation of its Charters Committee, of the appointment of the following person as a Member of the Governing Board (Board of Directors or Equivalent) of the following District Authorized Charter School, pursuant to Education Code §47604(b), effective March 11, 2020:
·	Anthony Wilson, Bay Area Technology Charter School Board; 
·	David Kakishiba, North Oakland Community Charter School Board;
·	Giselle Hendrie, Oakland Military Institute Board; and
·	Edward Huang, Vincent Academy Board.
